  <item>
    <title>05 《花样年华》从情欲中撤离，去时间里释怀</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67cf2b69e924d4525ab01545</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67cf2b69e924d4525ab01545</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Mar 2025 20:10:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【回味弧·影评】25年后的重映，墨镜王说他带来了最符合原先想法的版本，这个“原先想法”就和周慕云的秘密一样可供解读😏。本期节目先聊98分钟的老版本，再聊2025年导演特别版里5分钟的内容。有关王家卫电影可说的太多，音频剪辑的过程中我们不断发现被遗漏的点😔，只能放在下一次重映的时候再聊了，应该不会太久，猜测王家卫的剪辑台里应该还有不少未曝光的胶片，供他持续创作。</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：阿森、阿树</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show notes</span></p><span></span><p><span>初味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:00:26</a> 影片基本信息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="419">00:06:59</a> 花样年华形式对照，前著《对倒》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">00:09:29</a> 60年代香港的城市记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="675">00:11:15</a> 报纸邂逅与武侠小说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1087">00:18:07</a> 叙事形式 - 食物：芝麻糊、云吞面、电饭煲、牛扒蘸辣酱</span></p><span></span><p><span>中味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1915">00:31:55</a> 压抑的情感也称得上美？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2844">00:47:24</a> 旗袍为何是苏丽珍的保护色？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3272">00:54:32</a> 吴哥窟遗迹与周慕云的秘密</span></p><span></span><p><span>回味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3465">00:57:45</a> 从一些道具窥探王家卫电影宇宙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4273">01:11:13</a> 道德自律与情欲压抑的现代性困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5210">01:26:50</a> 新片段？2000年的便利店？蓝莓之夜？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4850">01:20:50</a> 墨镜王创作模式有哪些值得影像工作者借鉴？</span></p><span></span><p><span>开场音乐：梅林茂 - Yumeji's Theme</span></p><span></span><p><span>中场音乐：Nat King Cole - Aquellos Ojos Verdes ；Michael Galasso - ITMFL III</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾音乐：Nat King Cole - Quizas Quizas Quizas</span></p><span></span><p><span>特别鸣谢：RØDE深圳 提供录音场地支持</span></p><span></span><p><span>新版豆瓣官方海报</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmNppwvbC5rSd0CwqJGtL0cYmjG9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>对倒邮票</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk9yMLh-f1eZwuPVQIuYHBF8_oIy.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnQNAz3gtPou0alQhyZBTBG5NkIk.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>片尾字幕 对倒文字排版设计</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqbYlcU2PYGZ4H5hSEReKXm4EfdN.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrPSVkI7oWgPH6G6-67zMjGy_dMZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>对倒 户型图</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo8zj9BYUOeXl8zOy7goTk3QhBoK.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>周旋 &nbsp;几时我能够靠近你的怀抱（歌词）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi_Q0phajMgXdU7nMqA6vQz3ybcM.png"></figure>]]></description>
