  <item>
    <title>04 保险CEO刺客路易吉、洋抖难民与《出租车司机》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67bdf816606e5c5940d5e8e0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67bdf816606e5c5940d5e8e0</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Feb 2025 00:25:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【回味弧·影评】从前段时间小红书洋抖难民以及美国保险公司CEO被刺杀这两起社会事件，我们联想到马丁·斯科塞斯的这部电影《出租车司机》所表达的精神内核，因此从经典片单里将它提前置顶，想尽快和大家一起聊聊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>故事大纲：《出租车司机》由美国导演马丁·斯科塞斯执导，讲述了越战退伍士兵特拉维斯在1970年代纽约的孤独与暴力挣扎。当经济下行与阶级矛盾撕裂社会时，这位失眠的出租车司机试图通过刺杀政客与解救雏妓完成自我救赎。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：阿森、阿树、阿蔡</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show notes</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>初味</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">00:01:02</a> 《出租车司机》基本信息及时代背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">00:01:45</a> 从小红书洋抖难民以及美国保险公司CEO被刺杀事件看美国阶级矛盾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="458">00:07:38</a> 影片背景：70年代美国社会困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="711">00:11:51</a> 越战老兵视角下的出租车景框</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="757">00:12:37</a> 霓虹美学与污秽都市</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1178">00:19:38</a> 出租车司机的城市漫游者生存状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1438">00:23:58</a> 封闭空间隐喻纽约精神困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">00:27:30</a> 自我认知偏差引发的行为矛盾</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>中味</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2076">00:34:36</a> 纸巾盒隔断的阶级空间叙事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2216">00:36:56</a> 马丁·斯科塞斯标志性摇镜头运用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2562">00:42:42</a> 刺杀总统的性驱动力解构</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2778">00:46:18</a> 军服符号与身份认同的错位</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>回味</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3220">00:53:40</a> 暴力行为动机的双重解读</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3661">01:01:01</a> 刺杀失败后的英雄主义转向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4546">01:15:46</a> 德尼罗对镜独白的即兴经典时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span>开场音乐：Bernard Herrmann - Main Title (from Taxi Driver)</span></p><span></span><p><span>中场音乐：Bernard Herrmann - Phone Call &nbsp;I Realize How Much She Is Like the Others &nbsp;A Strange Customer &nbsp;Watching Palantine On TV &nbsp;You're Gonna Die In Hell &nbsp;Betsy's Theme &nbsp;Hitting the G；Dave Blume - Betsy In a White Dress；</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾音乐：Dave Blume - Theme from Taxi Driver (Reprise)</span></p><span></span><p><span>特别鸣谢：RØDE深圳 录音场地支持</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/676ec50fb7d37147a553cb42/lnxcP_ump7hQ7ao0pkbfXz3F6LT9.m4a" length="75063095" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:17:16</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg9D-ImspXOyae_rr-VFsCL_tfNo.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>03 在《家有喜事》中找消失的年味</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b3f49605a90dfd0d2ae5e7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b3f49605a90dfd0d2ae5e7</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Feb 2025 02:59:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目谈的电影是《家有喜事92》版本，对于这个春节假期，我们各自有许多新的观察，这个时代有很多东西都悄无声息的发生变化，包括家庭关系、媒介、娱乐模式、观众视角等等。透过《家有喜事》这部合家欢电影/贺岁档电影里熟悉的场面对照当下，能更明显的看到时代的痕迹。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你有更多想法，欢迎发表在评论区与我们讨论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：阿树、阿蔡、阿森</span></p><span></span><p><span>特别鸣谢：RØDE深圳 录音场地支持</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/676ec50fb7d37147a553cb42/ltPrDsoY4q8mZ7C-q_9pDVbk4VmS.m4a" length="68933933" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:10:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg9D-ImspXOyae_rr-VFsCL_tfNo.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>02 我不拍苦，拍甘。《上帝之手》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6794cad6d74435e4a3b5856c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6794cad6d74435e4a3b5856c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jan 2025 11:45:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【回味弧·影评】</span><br><span>《上帝之手》由意大利导演 保罗·索伦蒂诺 执导，讲述了他在1980年代那不勒斯的自传式青春往事。当马拉多纳转会轰动全城之际，高中生法比托也在经历着人生转折。一场意外夺去了他的双亲，让这个对电影怀有热忱的少年提前走向成熟。</span><br><span>本期嘉宾：阿森、阿树、阿蔡</span><br><span> </span><br><span>Show notes</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="89">00:01:29</a> 电影《上帝之手》基本信息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="191">00:03:11</a> 第一轮风味品鉴，叙事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">00:09:16</a> 究竟何为自传式影片，本片是否做到通过描述个人体现普世情感？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1487">00:24:47</a> 角色剖析，法比托为何能够瞬间成长？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1722">00:28:42</a> 角色剖析，青春期男性了解哲学和电影之前先要知道自己喜欢的异性类型</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1968">00:32:48</a> 角色剖析，那不勒斯海边风情画之皮草大衣老妇、海上藤原拓海</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2184">00:36:24</a> 第二轮风味品鉴，电影视听艺术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2211">00:36:51</a> 「上帝之手」的多重寓意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2509">00:41:49</a> 为何需要拍一场与老妇的床戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2788">00:46:28</a> 声画设计：外面是足球声欢呼，里面是离别与孤独</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2932">00:48:52</a> 现实主义题材里为何频繁出现超现实元素？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3229">00:53:49</a> 不足：这么美的景色，却没有贴合人物内心的镜头设计，可惜。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3625">01:00:25</a> 第三轮风味品鉴，影像回味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3642">01:00:42</a> 角色小姨深入灵魂的演技</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3813">01:03:33</a> 符号与象征：电影里的球状物体、片尾的电池</span></p><span></span><p><span>开场音乐：Nadia Sirota - Étude 3</span></p><span></span><p><span>中场音乐：St. Paul Chamber Orchestra,Christopher Hogwood,Gustav Holst - St. Paul's Suite, Op. 29 No. 2, H 1183. Intermezzo Andante con moto；Sol Gabetta - I. Prayer</span><br><span>片尾音乐：Pino Daniele - Napule è</span><br><span>特别鸣谢：RØDE深圳 录音场地支持</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/676ec50fb7d37147a553cb42/lmqhZ5EmqQMNZdaCv4MQ_OVzT_w-.m4a" length="68911117" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:10:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg9D-ImspXOyae_rr-VFsCL_tfNo.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>01 谁还在找《怪物》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678cd14f9420ede9d1207f9a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678cd14f9420ede9d1207f9a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jan 2025 10:41:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【回味弧·影评】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《怪物》由日本导演是枝裕和执导，获得第76届戛纳电影节最佳编剧奖。影片通过一个校园事件，让我们看到每个人眼中都有不同的「真相」。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：导演阿森、导演阿树、制片阿蔡。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show notes</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">00:03:56</a> 《怪物》的创作背景与幕后团队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="383">00:06:23</a> 解析三段式叙事结构设计</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="644">00:10:44</a> 多视角叙事如何巧妙营造悬念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="739">00:12:19</a> 校长角色塑造的戏剧变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1435">00:23:55</a> 从母亲视角看亲子关系的复杂性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1761">00:29:21</a> 社会期望与个人选择的矛盾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2155">00:35:55</a> 分析剧中配角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">00:38:30</a> 校长在超市绊倒小孩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2825">00:47:05</a> 深入「怪物」标签背后的社会思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3129">00:52:09</a> 电影形式与风格，各种道具的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3979">01:06:19</a> 分析山洞隧道场景的深层象征</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4180">01:09:40</a> 解读鞋子道具与人物关系暗示</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4575">01:16:15</a> 探究导演是枝裕和的创作理念</span></p><span></span><p><span>中场音乐：坂本龍一 - Monster 1</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾音乐：坂本龍一 - Aqua</span></p><span></span><p><span>特别鸣谢：RØDE深圳 录音场地支持</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/676ec50fb7d37147a553cb42/lgujO4CduC4EVXTdBDWoK9OS2jdw.m4a" length="162412627" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:24:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg9D-ImspXOyae_rr-VFsCL_tfNo.png"/>
